data: {"type":"question.verdict","questionId":"98dbefce-93bd-4521-b604-1d8e4f149812","responseMode":"escalate","headline":"일정 확인 필요 · 최종 결과는 언제쯤 나오나요?","condition":null,"evidence":[{"id":"df460c5c-e730-4d57-89d8-9d48bc979dc0","source_type":"release","source_url":"https://github.com/supabase/supabase/releases/tag/v1.24.09","external_ref":"v1.24.09","heading_path":"Developer Update - September 2024 > Launch Week 12 Hackathon Winners","content":"Developer Update - September 2024 > Launch Week 12 Hackathon Winners\n\nMany high quality projects were submitted for LW12’s hackathon but our panel of judges selected [Whisker Jam](https://supabase.link/whisker-jam-lw12) as Best Overall Project because of its cuteness (who doesn’t love cats), funky musical instruments, and multiplayer functionality. Congratulations 👏 to [@n0t_buddy](https://twitter.com/n0t_buddy) who will receive the prize of mechanical keyboards.\n\n[Full list of winners](https://supabase.link/lw12-hackathon-winners) | [All the submissions](https://supabase.link/lw12-submissions)","audience_level":"public","valid_from":"2024-10-09T15:00:00.000Z","distance":0.8019944665800405},{"id":"97f7cba9-fd2e-4682-8764-80b9ee70f3c4","source_type":"release","source_url":"https://github.com/supabase/supabase/releases/tag/v1.26.08","external_ref":"v1.26.08","heading_path":"Developer Update - August 2026 > Introducing Supabase Evals","content":"Developer Update - August 2026 > Introducing Supabase Evals\n\nSupabase Evals is now open source, a benchmark that runs AI coding agents like Claude Code and Codex against real Supabase tasks and publishes the scores.\n\n[Read the blog →](https://supabase.com/blog/introducing-supabase-evals)","audience_level":"public","valid_from":"2026-08-06T15:00:00.000Z","distance":0.810303016189263},{"id":"321b13df-48fc-4c1e-8de0-4489463acfe9","source_type":"release","source_url":"https://github.com/supabase/supabase/releases/tag/v1.24.09","external_ref":"v1.24.09","heading_path":"Developer Update - September 2024 > Supabase AI Hackathon at Y Combinator","content":"Developer Update - September 2024 > Supabase AI Hackathon at Y Combinator\n\nOn November 22 + 23 we’re hosting an AI-focused hackathon at Y Combinator in San Francisco. We’re welcoming anyone to apply and build the next wave of AI applications. The panel of judges will include our founders, [Paul Copplestone](https://x.com/kiwicopple) and [Ant Wilson](https://x.com/AntWilson), and YC partners.\n\n[Full announcement](https://supabase.link/supabase-yc-ai-hackathon)","audience_level":"public","valid_from":"2024-10-09T15:00:00.000Z","distance":0.8250987226165497}],"latencyMs":280}

